{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GaleShapleyEvent"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Free proposers are taken from a stack, lowest index first at the start. A free proposer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"proposes to the next reviewer on its list. The reviewer rejects a proposer it does not list or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ranks below the one it holds, accepts when it holds no one, and otherwise trades up, freeing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the proposer it held, who goes on top of the stack. A rejected proposer proposes again; an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accepted one waits. A proposer whose list runs out stays unmatched. The pairs held at the end"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stableMatching"},{"type":"text","text":"’s matching."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/matchingmodule\/galeshapleyevent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","externalID":"s:14MatchingModule16GaleShapleyEventO","modules":[{"name":"MatchingModule"}],"title":"GaleShapleyEvent","symbolKind":"enum","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"GaleShapleyEvents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/MatchingModule\/GaleShapleyEvents.swift#L10"},"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GaleShapleyEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GaleShapleyEvent"}]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"En